{
	"_readme": [
		"Shared input corpus for the fold MIGRATE twin (PHP bws_fold_migrate_slots ↔ JS",
		"bwsSlotFoldMigrate.migrateSlots). One file, two thin drivers, so a divergence",
		"between the converter's rewrite and the editor's mount rewrite fails a suite",
		"instead of writing two different wires for one tag.",
		"",
		"`conf` speaks the EDITOR's vocabulary — it is the `fold` config PHP registration",
		"ships to the control, `flatAxes` included. The PHP driver converts back to the",
		"migrator's `tag_level` (the complement), which is the direction the shipped code",
		"already goes.",
		"",
		"Behavioural expectations live in fold-migration-test.php; a row here costs one",
		"corpus entry and no expected value."
	],
	"cases": [
