	"_baseSrcReadme": "DEPTH-0 base-tag source migration (bws_fold_migrate_base_src / baseSrcState). Its own section, not a borrowed slot case: the slot cases exercise a container's per-slot keys, and nothing about them reaches the tag's own source triple. Results are compared as ORDERED KEY PAIRS because key order is half the property -- the two paths must write one tag ONE way.",
